{"sampleId": "sample-546652df7f336231f7da", "publicationId": "arxiv:1708.07747", "arxivId": "1708.07747", "text": "We present Fashion-MNIST, a new dataset comprising of 28x28 grayscale images of 70,000 fashion products from 10 categories, with 7,000 images per category.", "textSha256": "6a93822e6ce68da1486668114fce8ef2c3843f7e2da2199972853df178aa4d65", "textKind": "abstract_excerpt", "groupId": "abstract-paper-1708.07747", "split": "train", "schemaVersion": "course-abstract-excerpt-1", "contractSha256": "731ebbb34887d896a4509f92f9bec34b990c6393e6a8886208ab770a6c1458e4", "sourceCorpusSha256": "10f7554bf6ff1305f07cf18a9d9077467a539ea6fdc55c21fc3b6c7aa840cd7f", "sourceAbstractSha256": "ed839786306a490fbdd2cb9ddb08ca67697d39c9e9f53c5db0d4367c6b3640ef", "sourceURL": "http://arxiv.org/abs/1708.07747v2", "sourceOffset": {"start": 0, "end": 155}, "sourceOrigin": "cached_exposed_train_only"}
