{"sampleId": "sample-f04ee6622339b316a28e", "publicationId": "arxiv:1606.05250", "arxivId": "1606.05250", "text": "We present the Stanford Question Answering Dataset (SQuAD), a new reading comprehension dataset consisting of 100,000+ questions posed by crowdworkers on a set of Wikipedia articles, where the answer to each question is a segment of text from the corresponding reading passage.", "textSha256": "1efb1e2cb34dc88ae0317ef51da0e070af03c21a9b9ef7958d48e83cd5b14397", "textKind": "abstract_excerpt", "groupId": "abstract-paper-1606.05250", "split": "train", "schemaVersion": "course-abstract-excerpt-1", "contractSha256": "731ebbb34887d896a4509f92f9bec34b990c6393e6a8886208ab770a6c1458e4", "sourceCorpusSha256": "10f7554bf6ff1305f07cf18a9d9077467a539ea6fdc55c21fc3b6c7aa840cd7f", "sourceAbstractSha256": "02dac2bf8f730df8a3b70a4e3979b7f929da433d510c8f603e183db5573ec848", "sourceURL": "http://arxiv.org/abs/1606.05250v3", "sourceOffset": {"start": 0, "end": 277}, "sourceOrigin": "cached_exposed_train_only"}
{"sampleId": "sample-52806021739c1b022337", "publicationId": "arxiv:1804.07461", "arxivId": "1804.07461", "text": "In pursuit of this objective, we introduce the General Language Understanding Evaluation benchmark (GLUE), a tool for evaluating and analyzing the performance of models across a diverse range of existing NLU tasks.", "textSha256": "827204bd011cdfc50763407b1d75816cf87903188c1ee33268aa350acba1fde1", "textKind": "abstract_excerpt", "groupId": "abstract-paper-1804.07461", "split": "train", "schemaVersion": "course-abstract-excerpt-1", "contractSha256": "731ebbb34887d896a4509f92f9bec34b990c6393e6a8886208ab770a6c1458e4", "sourceCorpusSha256": "10f7554bf6ff1305f07cf18a9d9077467a539ea6fdc55c21fc3b6c7aa840cd7f", "sourceAbstractSha256": "3045e4afbeeff5bce8cdf55cab7475920ce2ed586ff56e6defaf9ab5c99699c0", "sourceURL": "http://arxiv.org/abs/1804.07461v3", "sourceOffset": {"start": 265, "end": 479}, "sourceOrigin": "cached_exposed_train_only"}
